{
  "_comment": [
    "Catalogue of consoles from 2000 onward, plus the pre-2000 systems already",
    "in use. This is the 'Add platform' list. An entry only describes the",
    "SYSTEM; the launch contract is filled in from `emulators` when one of them",
    "is installed, and stays editable afterwards.",
    "",
    "Entries with an empty `emulators` list are deliberate: no usable Android",
    "emulator exists yet. They are listed so that when one appears it is a",
    "config edit, not an app update. `verified` is true ONLY where a real game",
    "was launched on this device."
  ],
